@startuml
title NestJS — controle temporário de localização por rota (v1.4.0 proposta)
actor "Cliente" as Client
participant "Socket.IO Gateway" as WS
participant "RoutesController HTTP" as HTTP
participant "Policy HMAC" as Policy
participant "RoutesService" as Routes
participant "RoutesDriverService" as Driver
collections "Sala route:<id>" as Room
Client -> WS : connect auth.token
WS -> Policy : readRouteAccessToken(token, secret, now)
alt token inválido ou sem secret
 Policy --> WS : null
 WS --> Client : disconnect
else válido
 Policy --> WS : routeId, scope, exp
 WS -> Room : join somente na rota autorizada
 WS -> WS : desconectar quando expirar
 Client -> WS : client:new-points(route_id)
 alt scope != simulate ou routeId diferente
  WS --> Client : WsException
 else autorizado
  WS -> Routes : findOne(routeId)
  WS -> Room : emit apenas na sala da rota
 end
end
group Ingestão HTTP separada
 Client -> HTTP : POST /routes/{id}/process-route\nAuthorization: Bearer capability
 HTTP -> Policy : verificar scope simulate, rota e TTL
 alt ausente, inválida ou rota distinta
  HTTP --> Client : 401, sem escrever
 else válida
  HTTP -> Driver : processRoute(route_id, lat, lng)
  Driver -> Room : emitNewPoints só para assinantes da rota
 end
end
note bottom
Emissor de capabilities exige ACL de conta externa, não implementada.
Demais endpoints HTTP necessitam RBAC, TLS e integração real.
end note
@enduml
